<title>USA: TABLE - Mycogen Corp Q3 shr down after charge.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Mycogen Corp Q3 shr down after charge.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.02   profit	 $0.11</p>
<p> Net profit		   564   profit	 3,521</p>
